  "summary": "Malicious code in lodsh-cli (npm)",
  "details": "The postinstall hook (scripts/postinstall.js) runs on install and contacts a hardcoded C2 at 193[.]70[.]34[.]101:20099, POSTing host metadata (platform, arch, node version) to the /vote endpoint. On Windows and WSL hosts it additionally XOR-decodes a GitHub URL (github[.]com/bebraz1/qPzM50V1AKG0rVlH/releases/download/...), downloads a binary to C:\\Temp\\main.exe, and launches it as a detached background process; on WSL it also executes a shell bridge command via the system shell. The package name lodsh-cli impersonates lodash.",
